'''Melee weapons''' are all [[weapon]]s that don't launch a projectile with their basic attack. Melee weapons include [[sword]]s, [[dagger]]s, [[axe]]s, [[claw]]s, [[staves]], [[mace]]s and [[fishing rod]]s. These weapons can be wielded to use [[melee skill]]s. 

